  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-09-13T16:16:36.332Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Some networks, particularly mobile phone networks restrict the bandwidth available for pulling video via the YouTube CDN.\n\nyt-dlp allows the user to set a maximum video stream quality with the `--format` argument.\n\nFor my network I would need to use `--format=bestvideo[height<=?480]+bestaudio/best`, but other options would work for other users.\n\nPlease allow for the ability to pass through a format argument on the vrchat cli or alternatively allow for arbitrary config or arguments passed to yt-dlp.\n\nOr if one can override it using a standard conf file next to yt-dlp, document this on the wiki.",
